 },
 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "little-big-adventure-twinsen-s-quest-241954@1.2",
   "gameId": "little-big-adventure-twinsen-s-quest-241954",
   "displayName": "Update 1.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-12T09:05:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone! 👋",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Update 1.2 for LBA – Twinsen's Quest is now live for everyone.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A few days ago, we opened a preview branch and asked for your help. You played it, broke it, and told us exactly what to change. This update is the result. Thank you to every tester who posted feedback and bug reports on Discord and Steam. 🙏",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What's in 1.2",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🎮 Couch co-op: up to 3 players on the same screen, with 40 characters to choose from",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🛡️ A drivable tank in the Hamalayi",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "⚔️ Punchier combat: impact freeze, camera shake, vibrations and a new lock-on, plus optional combos, magic ball recall and ricochets",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🗺️ Objectives on the Holomap and the HUD",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🧣 A snow costume for Twinsen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔊 A refreshed main menu, menu sounds and better gamepad navigation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🍏 A native MacOS version (Apple Silicon)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "📜 Signs and readables with a new look",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎮 Couch co-op (up to 3 players)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43801523/782626525d7b6c87a930f78a244f9a220441892f.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Choose Single player or Multiplayer from the main menu, and up to two companions can join on the same screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👦 It's a mode made mainly to play with your children 👧🏻 (I made it to play with my daughters).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Pick your companion",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Each companion picks a character from 40 to choose from: Zoé, Luna, Baldino, Bob Vortix, Lightning, Professor Bloop, and many more Sphero, Rabbibunny and Grobo friends.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And for a throwback: the original 1994 Twinsen and Zoé are playable too.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43801523/abb4cccffd57e8f948fd9dd3eebcb989ed5de7d7.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "How it works",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Each companion plays on their own gamepad. You can choose whether controller 1 is Twinsen's, or whether Twinsen plays on keyboard and every gamepad goes to the companions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Each companion chooses auto-lock or manual aim on their player card.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Companions have their own colour, their own life bar, and unlimited clovers. We're not monsters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They throw their own magic ball, use the Proto-Pack (D-pad Up), and can grab and push crates, even the same crate as someone else.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They follow Twinsen from room to room. If one gets stuck or left behind, they catch up on their own.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They freeze during dialogues and hide when Twinsen hides.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The camera pulls back a little to keep everyone in frame.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rumble only goes to the controller of the player it concerns.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🛡️ Drive the Hamalayi tank",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43801523/e0f6cf66dc4eb3504301ed9927c537ad5d334c1f.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The tank in the Hamalayi is now playable. Climb in, roll through the snow, and blast your way to the fort.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can leave the tank anywhere, including next to ledges and walls. Only the passage into the fort needs the tank, and a hint explains this.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The tank tutorial shows the right keyboard keys for each direction.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⚔️ Game feel and combat",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Each feature has its own switch in Options → Advanced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "On by default: impact freeze, camera shake, controller vibration and the new lock-on. You can turn any of them off.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optional: melee combos, damaging recall and ricochet chains are off by default. Turn them on to try them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Game feel (on by default)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Impact freeze: a short pause on melee, saber and magic ball hits, and on kills. Makes hits land.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Camera shake: the camera kicks when you get hit or take down a tough enemy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Controller vibration: rumble on hits and key moments, strong and easy to feel, especially on DualSense.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Combat (optional)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Melee combos: a three-hit chain, with input buffering so your presses link up instead of getting eaten. Holding the attack button doesn't lock Twinsen in place.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Damaging recall: the magic ball waits on the ground. Call it back and it flies home with physics, hurting any enemy on the way. You can also pick it up by walking over it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ricochet chains: the ball bounces from enemy to enemy. The number of bounces grows with your magic level: none at level 0, up to four at level 4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Lock-on update (on by default)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A ring under your target with a health gauge. A trailing arc shows the damage of your last hit. Double ring when you're hard-locked.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Same colour code: yellow out of range, green you can hurt it, red it's immune.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A lock sound, right stick to switch targets, and no more locking enemies through walls.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tip: try the optional features one at a time first, then all together. They don't feel the same.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🗺️ Objectives",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Your current objective is shown on the Holomap, and you can also show it on the HUD.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Holomap shows the objectives for the island you're looking at.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The objective banner stays visible alongside item notifications, and updates right away if you change the language.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The way to the Clear Water Lake is clearer, with new objectives \"Find the rebel command\" and \"Talk to Carotina\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Objective texts are available in every language.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🧣 Snow costume",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Twinsen gets a snow costume, ready for the cold of the Hamalayi. He keeps it on in the buggy, the fishing boat and on the motorbike.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43801523/34eab8eb0ac00e6250700bd6b3efc064cfa261d7.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🍏 MacOS version",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "LBA – Twinsen's Quest now runs natively on Mac (Apple Silicon only).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "📜 Signs and readables",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Signs, plates and posters have a new look: each one is shown on the support that matches the 3D object you read it on, with the text centred on the paper. The museum price board and the Fortress training pool notice get the same treatment.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🛠️ Other fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Chapter 0: Zoé no longer disappears if she falls into the water, which could block the Boing-ball scene. She also waits on the pier while Twinsen drowns instead of following him in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pouring the clear water shows the blue flask in Twinsen's hand instead of the red syrup bottle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "French: the missing \"Ville fleurie\" is back on the Principal Island sign.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Were you on the preview branch?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Everything from the preview is now in the regular version. You can go back to it: right-click the game in your Steam library → Properties → Betas → select None.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Keep the feedback coming",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "And if you're enjoying the game, a Steam review helps us more than you'd think. 💙",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you on Twinsun!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ben",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
